{"title": "Stirring Execution", "pageid": 28033, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Stirring_Execution", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Stirring Execution</b> is a passive feature which grants allies temporary hit points based on their respective <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> modifiers when the wielder of <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Duke_Ravengard%27s_Longsword\" title=\"Duke Ravengard's Longsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Duke_Ravengard%27s_Longsword\" title=\"Duke Ravengard's Longsword\">Duke Ravengard's Longsword</a> kills an enemy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you kill an enemy, allies within 9 m (30 ft) gain <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a> equal to your<sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup> Charisma <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Modifier\">Modifier</a> (minimum 1). \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_.28Stirring_Execution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Temporary_Hit_Points_(Stirring_Execution)\"> Condition: Temporary Hit Points (Stirring Execution) </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(Stirring_Execution)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (Stirring Execution) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Temporary Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/10/Temporary_Hit_Points_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points_(Stirring_Execution)_(Condition)\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points (Stirring Execution) (Condition)\">Temporary Hit Points</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has gained <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/38px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Charisma modifier temporary hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/25px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Charisma modifier <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary hit points</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Duke_Ravengard%27s_Longsword\" title=\"Duke Ravengard's Longsword\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Longsword_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Duke_Ravengard%27s_Longsword\" title=\"Duke Ravengard's Longsword\">Duke Ravengard's Longsword</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Ulder Ravengard</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The temporary hit points are actually based on the Charisma modifiers of the characters <i>receiving</i> them, not the character delivering the killing blow with this sword. The minimum of 1 still applies.\n<ul><li>The temporary hit points only have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1, and as such are overridden by any other source of temporary hit points which have a <code>StackPriority</code> of 1 or higher, even if the new source is of a lesser value.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Upon killing an enemy, allies within 9 m (30 ft) gain <a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Temporary Hit Points\">temporary HP</a> based on <a href=\"/wiki/CHA\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CHA\">CHA</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201950\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1626/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 18163/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7117/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 148/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936713/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.022      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   56.022      1 -total\n 42.04%   23.549      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 37.87%   21.214      1 Template:PageSeo\n 27.53%   15.422      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 23.91%   13.396      2 Template:Item_icon\n 20.18%   11.305      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 14.08% 